/* Polypropylene (PP) CubeTen test — the data behind the "real test" section on
   /plastic-testing. GENERATED from the 2026-08-20-MODULUS-PP CONTROL export
   (summary.csv, samples.csv, series/sample_1_stress_strain.csv); do not hand-edit
   the numbers — regenerate from the export instead.

   PP_SERIES is specimen 1's first ~50 s, one point per 0.1 s: [time s, strain %,
   stress MPa]. The test video is specimen 1 over the same window.

   PP_SPEED_KEYFRAMES drive the live crosshead-speed readout. The method runs
   1 mm/min until 0.3% strain, which specimen 1 reaches at 29.61 s, then
   50 mm/min to break. Keyframe times are VIDEO seconds; retime them (or the
   island's syncOffset) when the video is synchronized precisely. */

